<title>USA: Tandy Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Tandy Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.60		    $0.48</p>
<p> Net shr		     0.43		     0.21</p>
<p> Net			 25,600		   14,500</p>
<p> Revs		   1,291,700		1,447,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  56,300		   61,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for Q1 was $0.49 per share.</p>
<p>Q1 oper share is on an &quot;on-going&quot; store basis.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 net shr includes $0.17 per share costs associated with exiting Incredible Universe electronics superstores.</p>
<p>(( -- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
